cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use one of these results, please cite this repository and name the specific result folder (for example results/polygon-n4)."
title: "ai-math-results: AI-generated, computer-checked mathematical results"
abstract: >-
  Original mathematical results with certificates and independent checkers, for example the n = 4 case of
  the Agaev-Chebotarev 2005 polygon conjecture, Erdős problem #580 for n <= 21, and lonely runner certificates.
  Each result folder states exactly what is proved and how to check it. Generated by AI (Claude, Anthropic)
  under Lee Marshall's direction; not peer reviewed by humans unless a result says so.
authors:
  - family-names: Marshall
    given-names: Lee
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/LeeMarshall1113/ai-math-results"
keywords: [combinatorics, computer-assisted proof, certificates, formal verification]
